// Auto-generated FSM tables for ship-size elimination logic.
// One table set per ship size (2, 3, 4). Submarines (size 1) handled separately.
// State index 0 is always the initial "all placements alive" state.
// transitions[state][col] = next state index after firing at `col` (0-indexed 0..7, representing
//   inner columns 1..8) and getting a result that does NOT include this ship size.
// values[state][col] = number of placements eliminated by firing at `col` in this state
//   (i.e. the immediate information/elimination value of that shot for this ship size).

